e effects produced on the individuals and on their descendants by the artificial mode of existence imposed by the factory.","start":50.73,"end":61.28,"score":0.989,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-016-005","sourceId":"b4-016-005","sourceIndex":4,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,11],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"The great cities have been built with no regard for us.","start":62.23,"end":65.93,"score":0.995,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-016-006-p01","sourceId":"b4-016-006","sourceIndex":5,"part":1,"parts":2,"wordRange":[0,22],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"The shape and dimensions of the skyscrapers depend entirely on the necessity of obtaining the maximum income per square foot of ground,","start":66.76,"end":75.75,"score":0.977,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-016-006-p02","sourceId":"b4-016-006","sourceIndex":5,"part":2,"parts":2,"wordRange":[22,34],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"and of offering to the tenants offices and apartments that please them.","start":76.062,"end":80.8,"score":0.87,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-016-007","sourceId":"b4-016-007","sourceIndex":6,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,17],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"This caused the construction of gigantic buildings where too large masses of human beings are crowded together.","start":81.92,"end":90.01,"score":0.935,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-016-008","sourceId":"b4-016-008","sourceIndex":7,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,8],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Civilized men like such a way of living.","start":91.33,"end":94.02,"score":0.991,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-016-009-p01","sourceId":"b4-016-009","sourceIndex":8,"part":1,"parts":2,"wordRange":[0,11],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"While they enjoy the comfort and banal luxury of their dwelling,","start":94.61,"end":98.38,"score":0.98,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-016-009-p02","sourceId":"b4-016-009","sourceIndex":8,"part":2,"parts":2,"wordRange":[11,24],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"they do not realize that they are deprived of the necessities of life.","start":98.8,"end":102.92,"score":0.987,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-016-010-p01","sourceId":"b4-016-010","sourceIndex":9,"part":1,"parts":2,"wordRange":[0,19],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"The modern city consists of monstrous edifices and of dark, narrow streets full of petrol fumes and toxic gases,","start":104.01,"end":112.0,"score":0.978,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-016-010-p02","sourceId":"b4-016-010","sourceIndex":9,"part":2,"parts":2,"wordRange":[19,35],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"torn by the noise of the taxicabs, lorries and buses, and thronged ceaselessly by great crowds.","start":112.5,"end":119.88,"score":0.944,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-016-011","sourceId":"b4-016-011","sourceIndex":10,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,12],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Obviously, it has not been planned for the good of its inhabitants.","start":120.58,"end":124.3,"score":0.982,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]}]}
